  "streams": [
    {
      "code": "eSTAR",
      "name": "eSTAR Stream",
      "description": "eSTAR (Energy/Environment in Science, Technology & Advanced Research) is a stream under the University's Talents Programme.\n\nComponents:\n(i) ESE or EVE major\n(ii) Research component (X): SEE4993 Research Seminar (1 CU) + Guided Study / Special Project (3-6 CU), total 7+ CU\n(iii) Minor study (Y), choose one of:\n  • Computing (COMP) – 15 CU\n  • Data Science (DSC) – 18 CU\n  • Innovation Management and Entrepreneurship (IME) – 15 CU\n  • International Business (IB) – 15 CU\n\n8 Tracks available (Major × Minor combinations).\n\nAdmission: DSE ≥28 / IB ≥38 for high school entrants; or CGPA top 10% after Year 1 for SEE students.\nStudents must maintain CGPA ≥3.40 every semester. Those who opt out are not allowed to be re-admitted.",
